		{"id":"header_labs","type":"group","x":-1060,"y":260,"width":300,"height":600,"color":"5","label":"🧪 Hands-On Labs"},
		{"id":"labs_header","type":"text","text":"### [[GitHub Actions Todo|GitHub Actions Labs Roadmap]]","x":-1040,"y":310,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"labs_list","type":"text","text":"### Lab Roadmap\n- [ ] Lab 1: Foundational Matrix 🟡\n- [ ] Lab 2: AWS OIDC Federation ⚪\n- [ ] Lab 3: Terraform PR Pipeline ⚪\n- [ ] Lab 4: Multi-Arch Containers ⚪\n- [ ] Lab 5: GitOps ArgoCD Bridge ⚪\n- [ ] Lab 6: ARC on EKS Spot ⚪","x":-1040,"y":400,"width":260,"height":430,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"header_arch_diagram","type":"group","x":-680,"y":260,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"6","label":"🏗️ Enterprise OIDC Architecture"},
		{"id":"card_oidc","type":"text","text":"### AWS OIDC Web Identity Flow\n```\nGitHub Runner (GHA)\n  ↓ id-token: write\nGitHub OIDC Token Provider\n  ↓ Signed JWT\nAWS STS AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity\n  ↓ Validates sub claim:\n  ↓ repo:org/repo:ref:refs/heads/main\nTemporary AWS Credentials (1 hr)\n```\n\n### Security Advantages\n- Zero long-lived secret keys\n- Automatic rotation every run\n- Scoped to exact repo and branch","x":-660,"y":310,"width":340,"height":520,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"header_pipeline_flow","type":"group","x":-220,"y":260,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"6","label":"🔄 Production GitOps CI/CD Flow"},
		{"id":"card_gitops_flow","type":"text","text":"### GitOps Hand-Off Lifecycle\n`PR Opened`\n↓ `fmt` + `validate` + `tflint`\n↓ `checkov` + `infracost diff`\n↓ `terraform plan` → PR comment\n`PR Merged to Main`\n↓ `docker buildx` (type=gha cache)\n↓ `trivy scan` → SARIF upload\n↓ `cosign sign` image\n↓ Commit new tag to GitOps Repo\n↓ **ArgoCD reconciles to EKS**","x":-200,"y":310,"width":340,"height":520,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"header_finops","type":"group","x":240,"y":260,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"6","label":"💰 FinOps & ARC Infrastructure"},
		{"id":"card_finops","type":"text","text":"### Cost Comparison (Monthly)\n- **GitHub-Hosted:** $0.008/min\n  (50k mins = $400/mo)\n- **ARC on EKS Spot:** ~$0.0015/min\n  (50k mins = ~$75/mo)\n  **Savings: ~81%**\n\n### Core Best Practices\n1. `timeout-minutes: 15` guardrail\n2. `cancel-in-progress: true`\n3. `cache-to: type=gha,mode=max`\n4. Ephemeral runner pods (0 to N)","x":260,"y":310,"width":340,"height":520,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"header_questions","type":"group","x":700,"y":260,"width":340,"height":600,"color":"2","label":"❓ Senior Interview Questions"},
		{"id":"card_questions","type":"text","text":"### Deep-Dive Interview Scenarios\n- [ ] Difference between `pull_request` and `pull_request_target`?\n- [ ] Why is OIDC safer than AWS static keys?\n- [ ] How to dynamically construct a matrix using a previous job output?\n- [ ] Why set `cancel-in-progress: false` for terraform apply?\n- [ ] How does ARC scale-to-zero work on EKS?\n- [ ] How do Reusable Workflows compare to Composite Actions?","x":720,"y":310,"width":300,"height":520,"color":"2"}
	],
